From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mmc: sunxi: Add allwinner,sample-delay

A board whose routing needs another sample delay than the calibrated
one gives it as allwinner,sample-delay, in the host's delay-line steps,
which take six bits.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
@@ -83,6 +83,14 @@
       - const: output
       - const: sample
 
+  allwinner,sample-delay:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    maximum: 63
+    description:
+      The fixed sample delay, in the host's delay-line steps, at which the
+      controller samples a high-speed card's data, where the board's routing
+      needs other than the calibrated one.
+
   resets:
     maxItems: 1
 
